.TH CLOC 1 "2026-08-16" "notcoreutils" "notcoreutils Manual"
.SH NAME
cloc \- count lines of code for this project
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B cloc
[\fIROOT\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B cloc
is a standalone cloc\-style line counter for this project. It walks
src/, project/, tests/, benchmark/, and proof_cbmc/ under ROOT
(defaulting to the directory this binary is invoked from \- walking
upward is not attempted, pass the project root explicitly if not the
current directory), classifies each file into a category by path
prefix (code/demo/tests/bench/project/proof), and prints one row per
category plus a total, distinguishing comment lines from code lines.
